OL,3,GNEWSAStudents 'crammed' on trains
OL,4,Aprompt extra buses
OL,5,
OL,6,FOvercrowding on railway lines popular
OL,7,Fwith college students and school pupils
OL,8,Fhas prompted a train firm to lay on
OL,9,Fextra buses.
OL,11,FStudents on the train between
OL,12,FBarnstaple and Exeter say they have
OL,13,Fbeen "crammed like sardines" on the
OL,14,Ftrain with claims of staff telling
OL,15,Fyoung people to leave the train and
OL,16,Ftake the bus.
OL,18,FRail passenger groups say a shortage of
OL,19,Frolling stock in south-west England is
OL,20,Faffecting services more widely with
OL,21,Fextra buses also being laid on between
OL,22,FPlymouth and Liskeard.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
